OL,3,GNEWSACrisp factory plan for two-tonne
OL,4,Aper hour production
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crisp factory will be able to fry
OL,7,Ftonnes of snacks a day under plans to
OL,8,Fbuild a new warehouse.
OL,10,FKP Snacks in Billingham, County Durham,
OL,11,Fhas applied to Stockton Council for
OL,12,Fplanning permission for a building
OL,13,Fwhich would house a heat exchanger used
OL,14,Fto warm up cooking oil for production
OL,15,Fof about two tonnes of finished product
OL,16,Fper hour.
OL,18,FIn planning documents, the firm
OL,19,Fdescribed the project as "a natural
OL,20,Fexpansive progression on the wider
OL,21,Ffactory site" making the production
OL,22,Fprocess more sustainable.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
